{"from":"3:15","body":"<p>hath taken.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.30.23 PSA.85.3 ISA.25.8 ISA.40.1 ISA.40.2 ISA.51.22 MIC.7.18-MIC.7.20 ZEC.1.14-ZEC.1.16\">Ge 30:23; Ps 85:3; Isa 25:8; 40:1,2; 51:22; Mic 7:18-20; Zec 1:14-16</ref><br/><ref to=\"ZEC.8.13-ZEC.8.15 ZEC.10.6 ZEC.10.7\">Zec 8:13-15; 10:6,7</ref><br/>he hath.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.13.1-ISA.14.32 JER.50.1-JER.51.64 MIC.7.10 MIC.7.16 MIC.7.17 HAB.2.8 HAB.2.17\">Isa 13:1-14:32; Jer 50:1-51:64; Mic 7:10,16,17; Hab 2:8,17</ref><br/><ref to=\"ZEC.2.8 ZEC.2.9 ZEC.12.3 ROM.8.33 ROM.8.34 REV.12.10\">Zec 2:8,9; 12:3; Ro 8:33,34; Re 12:10</ref><br/>the king.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.33.22 EZK.37.24 EZK.37.25 ZEC.9.9 JHN.1.49 JHN.12.15 JHN.19.19 REV.19.16\">Isa 33:22; Eze 37:24,25; Zec 9:9; Joh 1:49; 12:15; 19:19; Re 19:16</ref><br/>is in.<br/><ref to=\"ZEP.3.5 ZEP.3.17 EZK.37.26-EZK.37.28 EZK.48.35 JOL.3.20 JOL.3.21 REV.7.15 REV.21.3 REV.21.4\">5,17; Eze 37:26-28; 48:35; Joe 3:20,21; Re 7:15; 21:3,4</ref><br/>thou.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.35.10 ISA.51.22 ISA.60.18 ISA.65.19 EZK.39.29 JOL.3.17 AMO.9.15\">Isa 35:10; 51:22; 60:18; 65:19; Eze 39:29; Joe 3:17; Am 9:15</ref><br/><ref to=\"ZEC.14.11\">Zec 14:11</ref></p>"}
{"from":"3:16","body":"<p>be said.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.35.3 ISA.35.4 ISA.40.9 ISA.41.10 ISA.41.13 ISA.41.14 ISA.43.1 ISA.43.2 ISA.44.2 ISA.54.4 JER.46.27 JER.46.28\">Isa 35:3,4; 40:9; 41:10,13,14; 43:1,2; 44:2; 54:4; Jer 46:27,28</ref><br/><ref to=\"HAG.2.4 HAG.2.5 ZEC.8.15 JHN.12.12 HEB.12.12\">Hag 2:4,5; Zec 8:15; Joh 12:12; Heb 12:12</ref><br/>slack. or, faint.<br/><ref to=\"2CO.4.1 GAL.6.9 EPH.3.13 HEB.12.3-HEB.12.5 REV.2.3\">2Co 4:1; Ga 6:9; Eph 3:13; Heb 12:3-5; Re 2:3</ref></p>"}
{"from":"3:17","body":"<p>in the.<br/><ref to=\"ZEP.3.5 ZEP.3.15\">5,15</ref><br/>is mighty.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.17.1 GEN.18.14 PSA.24.8-PSA.24.10 ISA.9.6 ISA.12.2 ISA.12.6 ISA.63.12 HEB.7.25\">Ge 17:1; 18:14; Ps 24:8-10; Isa 9:6; 12:2,6; 63:12; Heb 7:25</ref><br/>will rejoice.<br/><ref to=\"NUM.14.8 DEU.30.9 PSA.147.11 PSA.149.4 ISA.62.4 ISA.62.5 ISA.65.19 JER.32.41\">Nu 14:8; De 30:9; Ps 147:11; 149:4; Isa 62:4,5; 65:19; Jer 32:41</ref><br/><ref to=\"LUK.15.5 LUK.15.6 LUK.15.23 LUK.15.24 LUK.15.32 JHN.15.11\">Lu 15:5,6,23,24,32; Joh 15:11</ref><br/>he will.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.1.31 GEN.2.2 ISA.18.4 JHN.13.1\">Ge 1:31; 2:2; Isa 18:4; Joh 13:1</ref><br/>rest. Heb. be silent.</p>"}
{"from":"3:18","body":"<p>gather.<br/><ref to=\"ZEP.3.20 JER.23.3 JER.31.8 JER.31.9 EZK.34.13 EZK.36.24 HOS.1.11 ROM.11.25 ROM.11.26\">20; Jer 23:3; 31:8,9; Eze 34:13; 36:24; Ho 1:11; Ro 11:25,26</ref><br/>sorrowful.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.42.2-PSA.42.4 PSA.43.3 PSA.63.1 PSA.63.2 PSA.84.1 PSA.84.2 PSA.137.3-PSA.137.6 LAM.1.4 LAM.1.7 LAM.2.6 LAM.2.7 HOS.9.5\">Ps 42:2-4; 43:3; 63:1,2; 84:1,2; 137:3-6; La 1:4,7; 2:6,7; Ho 9:5</ref><br/>the reproach of it was a burden. Heb. the burden upon it wasreproach.</p>"}
{"from":"3:19","body":"<p>I will undo.<br/><ref to=\"ZEP.3.15 ISA.25.9-ISA.25.12 ISA.26.11 ISA.41.11-ISA.41.16 ISA.43.14-ISA.43.17 ISA.49.25 ISA.49.26 ISA.51.22 ISA.51.23\">15; Isa 25:9-12; 26:11; 41:11-16; 43:14-17; 49:25,26; 51:22,23</ref><br/><ref to=\"ISA.66.14-ISA.66.16 JER.30.16 JER.46.28 JER.51.35 JER.51.36 EZK.39.17-EZK.39.22 JOL.3.2-JOL.3.9\">Isa 66:14-16; Jer 30:16; 46:28; 51:35,36; Eze 39:17-22; Joe 3:2-9</ref><br/><ref to=\"MIC.7.10 NAM.1.11-NAM.1.14 ZEC.2.8 ZEC.2.9 ZEC.12.3 ZEC.12.4 ZEC.14.2 ZEC.14.3 REV.19.17-REV.19.21 REV.20.9\">Mic 7:10; Na 1:11-14; Zec 2:8,9; 12:3,4; 14:2,3; Re 19:17-21; 20:9</ref><br/>and I will save.<br/><ref to=\"JER.31.8 EZK.34.16 MIC.4.6 MIC.4.7 HEB.12.13\">Jer 31:8; Eze 34:16; Mic 4:6,7; Heb 12:13</ref><br/>and I will.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.60.14 ISA.61.7 ISA.62.7 JER.33.9 EZK.39.26\">Isa 60:14; 61:7; 62:7; Jer 33:9; Eze 39:26</ref><br/>get them praise. Heb. set them for a praise. where they havebeen put to shame. Heb. of their shame.</p>"}
{"from":"3:20","body":"<p>even.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.11.11 ISA.11.12 ISA.27.12 ISA.27.13 ISA.56.8 EZK.28.25 EZK.34.16 EZK.37.21 EZK.39.28 AMO.9.14\">Isa 11:11,12; 27:12,13; 56:8; Eze 28:25; 34:16; 37:21; 39:28; Am 9:14</ref><br/>for.<br/><ref to=\"ZEP.3.19 ISA.60.15 ISA.61.9 ISA.62.7 ISA.62.12 MAL.3.12\">19; Isa 60:15; 61:9; 62:7,12; Mal 3:12</ref><br/>I turn.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.35.6 JER.29.14 EZK.16.53 JOL.3.1\">Ps 35:6; Jer 29:14; Eze 16:53; Joe 3:1</ref></p>"}
